{"seq":3,"slug":"lifecycle-management","title":"API 生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/lifecycle-management","wordCount":1316,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"api-生命周期管理\">API 生命周期管理</h1><p>一个 API 不是写完发布就万事大吉——它有从构想到退役的完整生命周期。当组织从 5 个 API 增长到 50 个、500 个时，缺乏统一的生命周期管理意味着：僵尸 API 消耗基础设施资源却无人维护，多个 API 功能重叠却无人知晓，关键 API 没有 Owner 导致安全漏洞无人修复。API 生命周期管理将每个 API 视为一个<strong>产品</strong>，赋予它明确的阶段、Owner 和退出条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>API 生命周期是一个有明确状态转移的流程——每个阶段有进入条件、执行动作和退出门禁：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Design&#10;    Design --&gt; Development: 设计评审通过&#10;    Development --&gt; Testing: 功能完整&#10;    Testing --&gt; Staging: 契约测试通过&#10;    Staging --&gt; Production: 性能/安全验收&#10;    Production --&gt; Deprecated: Sunset 决策&#10;    Deprecated --&gt; Retired: Sunset Date 到达&#10;    Retired --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Design\n    Design --&gt; Development: 设计评审通过\n    Development --&gt; Testing: 功能完整\n    Testing --&gt; Staging: 契约测试通过\n    Staging --&gt; Production: 性能/安全验收\n    Production --&gt; Deprecated: Sunset 决策\n    Deprecated --&gt; Retired: Sunset Date 到达\n    Retired --&gt; [*]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>关键活动</th>\n<th>退出门禁</th>\n<th>Owner 职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Design</td>\n<td>需求收集、资源建模、Spec 起草</td>\n<td>设计评审 + Lint 通过</td>\n<td>定义契约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Development</td>\n<td>实现、单元测试、Mock 验证</td>\n<td>功能完整 + Provider 测试通过</td>\n<td>实现逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Testing</td>\n<td>集成测试、性能测试、安全审计</td>\n<td>所有测试绿 + 安全扫描清</td>\n<td>质量保障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Production</td>\n<td>监控、告警、消费者支持</td>\n<td>持续满足 SLA</td>\n<td>运维 + 演进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deprecated</td>\n<td>迁移支持、Sunset 头部、流量监控</td>\n<td>消费者迁移率 &gt; 95%</td>\n<td>迁移引导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Retired</td>\n<td>停止服务、返回 410、数据归档</td>\n<td>无活跃消费者</td>\n<td>清理资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"api-作为产品的治理模型\">API 作为产品的治理模型</h2><h3 id=\"api-owner-制度\">API Owner 制度</h3><p>每个 API 必须有一个明确的 Owner（个人或团队），负责从设计到退役的全生命周期：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>设计决策权</strong>：资源模型、版本策略、兼容性规则</li>\n<li><strong>质量责任</strong>：SLA 达标、安全漏洞修复、文档更新</li>\n<li><strong>演进规划</strong>：功能路线图、废弃计划、消费者沟通</li>\n<li><strong>消费者支持</strong>：回答集成问题、处理变更请求</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无 Owner 的 API 应该被废弃——它已经是僵尸 API。</p>\n<h3 id=\"api-注册中心-api-catalog\">API 注册中心（API Catalog）</h3><p>组织级的 API 注册中心是生命周期管理的基础设施。每个 API 在注册中心有一条记录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;api_id&quot;: &quot;orders-api&quot;,&#10;  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Orders API&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.3.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;stage&quot;: &quot;production&quot;,&#10;  &quot;owner&quot;: &quot;team-commerce&quot;,&#10;  &quot;spec_url&quot;: &quot;https://specs.internal/orders/openapi.yaml&quot;,&#10;  &quot;docs_url&quot;: &quot;https://docs.internal/orders&quot;,&#10;  &quot;health_endpoint&quot;: &quot;https://api.internal/orders/health&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sla&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;availability&quot;: &quot;99.95%&quot;,&#10;    &quot;p99_latency_ms&quot;: 200&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;consumers&quot;: [&quot;web-frontend&quot;, &quot;mobile-app&quot;, &quot;analytics-pipeline&quot;],&#10;  &quot;created_at&quot;: &quot;2024-03-15&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sunset_date&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;commerce&quot;, &quot;tier-1&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"api_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders-api\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Orders API\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.3.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"team-commerce\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"spec_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://specs.internal/orders/openapi.yaml\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"docs_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://docs.internal/orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"health_endpoint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.internal/orders/health\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sla\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"availability\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"99.95%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"p99_latency_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"consumers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"web-frontend\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mobile-app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"analytics-pipeline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2024-03-15\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sunset_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"commerce\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"api-分级-tiering\">API 分级（Tiering）</h3><p>不是所有 API 同等重要。分级制度让治理力度与业务影响力匹配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>治理要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Tier 1</td>\n<td>核心业务、外部消费者、营收相关</td>\n<td>设计评审 + 契约测试 + SLA 监控 + 安全审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tier 2</td>\n<td>内部关键服务间 API</td>\n<td>契约测试 + 基础监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tier 3</td>\n<td>团队内部、实验性 API</td>\n<td>Lint 通过即可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Tier 1 API 的变更需要跨团队评审，Tier 3 API 可以快速迭代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性与健康监控\">可观测性与健康监控</h2><h3 id=\"关键指标-golden-signals\">关键指标（Golden Signals）</h3><p>每个生产 API 应监控四个黄金指标：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Golden Signals] --&gt; B[延迟 Latency]&#10;    A --&gt; C[流量 Traffic]&#10;    A --&gt; D[错误率 Errors]&#10;    A --&gt; E[饱和度 Saturation]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[P50 / P95 / P99]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[QPS / 按端点分解]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[5xx 率 / 按错误码分解]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[CPU / 内存 / 连接池]\">graph LR\n    A[Golden Signals] --&gt; B[延迟 Latency]\n    A --&gt; C[流量 Traffic]\n    A --&gt; D[错误率 Errors]\n    A --&gt; E[饱和度 Saturation]\n    B --&gt; B1[P50 / P95 / P99]\n    C --&gt; C1[QPS / 按端点分解]\n    D --&gt; D1[5xx 率 / 按错误码分解]\n    E --&gt; E1[CPU / 内存 / 连接池]</pre><h3 id=\"sla-slo-sli-层次\">SLA/SLO/SLI 层次</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>SLI（指标）</strong>：可观测的度量值，如 P99 延迟</li>\n<li><strong>SLO（目标）</strong>：内部承诺，如&quot;P99 &lt; 200ms&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>SLA（协议）</strong>：对外承诺+违约后果，如&quot;可用性 99.95%，否则信用补偿&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;slo&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;availability&quot;: { &quot;target&quot;: &quot;99.95%&quot;, &quot;window&quot;: &quot;30d&quot; },&#10;    &quot;latency_p99&quot;: { &quot;target&quot;: &quot;200ms&quot;, &quot;window&quot;: &quot;30d&quot; },&#10;    &quot;error_rate&quot;: { &quot;target&quot;: &quot;&lt;0.1%&quot;, &quot;window&quot;: &quot;1h&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;error_budget&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;monthly_downtime_budget&quot;: &quot;21.6min&quot;,&#10;    &quot;consumed&quot;: &quot;8.3min&quot;,&#10;    &quot;remaining&quot;: &quot;13.3min&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"slo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"availability\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"99.95%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"latency_p99\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"200ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"error_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;0.1%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error_budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"monthly_downtime_budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"21.6min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"consumed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"8.3min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"remaining\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"13.3min\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Error Budget（错误预算）</strong>：SLO 允许的&quot;犯错空间&quot;。当错误预算耗尽时，团队应该停止功能开发、专注可靠性——这是 Google SRE 实践的核心机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"废弃与退役流程\">废弃与退役流程</h2><h3 id=\"废弃触发条件\">废弃触发条件</h3><ul>\n<li>新版本已稳定运行 3+ 个月</li>\n<li>消费者已有可用的迁移路径</li>\n<li>旧版本维护成本超过收益</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"废弃期的操作\">废弃期的操作</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>通知消费者</strong>：邮件/文档/Changelog 告知 Sunset Date</li>\n<li><strong>响应头标注</strong>：<code>Deprecation: true</code> + <code>Sunset: &lt;date&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>监控迁移率</strong>：追踪旧版本的流量占比</li>\n<li><strong>提供迁移工具</strong>：自动化脚本、SDK 升级指南、兼容层</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"退役期的操作\">退役期的操作</h3><p>Sunset Date 到达后：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"GET /v1/orders/123&#10;HTTP/1.1 410 Gone&#10;Content-Type: application/json&#10;&#10;{&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;code&quot;: &quot;API_RETIRED&quot;,&#10;    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;This API version has been retired as of 2026-07-01.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;migration_url&quot;: &quot;https://docs.api.com/migration/v1-to-v2&quot;,&#10;    &quot;new_endpoint&quot;: &quot;https://api.example.com/v2/orders/123&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /v1/orders/123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 410 Gone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"error\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"code\": \"API_RETIRED\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"message\": \"This API version has been retired as of 2026-07-01.\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"migration_url\": \"https://docs.api.com/migration/v1-to-v2\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"new_endpoint\": \"https://api.example.com/v2/orders/123\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据生命周期\">数据生命周期</h3><p>API 退役不等于数据删除。退役后：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据保留 90 天供消费者导出</li>\n<li>审计日志永久归档</li>\n<li>测试环境可能继续保留旧版本供回归验证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"api-治理的组织模式\">API 治理的组织模式</h2><h3 id=\"集中式-vs-联邦式\">集中式 vs 联邦式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>集中式</td>\n<td>&lt;20 个 API</td>\n<td>一致性高、标准统一</td>\n<td>瓶颈、不了解业务细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联邦式</td>\n<td>20-200 个 API</td>\n<td>各团队自治 + 共享标准</td>\n<td>需要 Platform Team 维护工具链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场式</td>\n<td>200+ 个 API</td>\n<td>内部 API 市场化运营</td>\n<td>复杂、适合大型组织</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年主流趋势是<strong>联邦式</strong>：Platform Team 维护工具链（lint 规则、CI 模板、注册中心），各业务团队在标准框架内自治管理各自的 API。</p>\n<h3 id=\"api-设计评审委员会\">API 设计评审委员会</h3><p>对 Tier 1 API 的重大变更（新 API、破坏性变更、废弃决策），设立跨团队评审：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>参与者：API Owner + 主要消费者代表 + Platform Team</li>\n<li>产出：设计文档 + 决策记录</li>\n<li>频率：按需（有重大变更时召集），不是定期会议</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>API 生命周期从 Design 到 Retired 有明确阶段、门禁和 Owner 职责</li>\n<li>每个 API 必须有 Owner——无 Owner 的 API 就是僵尸 API</li>\n<li>API 注册中心是治理的基础设施，记录每个 API 的状态、Owner、消费者、SLA</li>\n<li>四个黄金指标（延迟/流量/错误率/饱和度）+ Error Budget 机制驱动可靠性</li>\n<li>废弃是一个有时间线的流程：通知 → 头部标注 → 监控迁移率 → 410 Gone</li>\n<li>联邦式治理（Platform Team 维护标准 + 业务团队自治）是 2026 年的主流</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"contract-testing\">契约测试与 CI 自动化</a> — 生命周期各阶段的自动化质量门禁</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-engineering/mfe-deployment\">微前端部署策略</a> — 前端与 API 的协同发布策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"API 生命周期管理","id":"api-生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"API 作为产品的治理模型","id":"api-作为产品的治理模型"},{"level":3,"text":"API Owner 制度","id":"api-owner-制度"},{"level":3,"text":"API 注册中心（API Catalog）","id":"api-注册中心-api-catalog"},{"level":3,"text":"API 分级（Tiering）","id":"api-分级-tiering"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性与健康监控","id":"可观测性与健康监控"},{"level":3,"text":"关键指标（Golden Signals）","id":"关键指标-golden-signals"},{"level":3,"text":"SLA/SLO/SLI 层次","id":"sla-slo-sli-层次"},{"level":2,"text":"废弃与退役流程","id":"废弃与退役流程"},{"level":3,"text":"废弃触发条件","id":"废弃触发条件"},{"level":3,"text":"废弃期的操作","id":"废弃期的操作"},{"level":3,"text":"退役期的操作","id":"退役期的操作"},{"level":3,"text":"数据生命周期","id":"数据生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"API 治理的组织模式","id":"api-治理的组织模式"},{"level":3,"text":"集中式 vs 联邦式","id":"集中式-vs-联邦式"},{"level":3,"text":"API 设计评审委员会","id":"api-设计评审委员会"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"契约测试与 CI 自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/contract-testing"},"next":null}